# Everything in this folder is regenerated by running the script, so none of it
# is carried in the repo. `uv run 01_eda.py` rebuilds all of it in about a
# minute, and the README describes what each figure shows rather than embedding
# it — so a fresh clone is not missing anything it needs to read.
#
# Same rule the five exercises follow: their --plot and --report output is
# gitignored too. Committing generated figures means every rerun shows up as a
# binary diff nobody can review.

# Cached copy of the UCI download.
breast_cancer_wisconsin.csv

# Figures written by 01_eda.py.
*.png
